    "created_at": "2026-11-09T16:45:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-09T16:45:46Z",
    "body": "I had to remove the G30 Z0 lines from beginning and end of the toolpath. My machine has Z0 set to the tool all the way down. this would have driven the spindle and tool into the workpiece rather than up and away as it was intended.",
